gs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/qtyzdgkdzfxx/202212/t20221202_1854673.htm", "content": "\n各县（市、区）人民政府，市直各单位：\n为培育壮大龙头企业，推进农业产业化发展，通过企业自愿上报、专家评审、媒体公示、企业复议等程序，确定了名佑（福建）食品有限公司等326家企业为第六轮农业产业化市级重点龙", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/qtyzdgkdzfxx/202212/t20221202_1854673.htm", "docreltime": "2022.12.02 16:19:00", "doctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于公布第六轮农业产业化市级重点龙头企业的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明政办〔2022〕47号", "idxid": "SM00100-3000-2022-00252", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2022.11.30 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人民政府办公室", "recid": 2019517, "sourcename": "政府信息公开办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/qtyzdgkdzfxx/202212/t20221202_1854673.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "[原件]明政办〔2022〕47号（关于公布第六轮农业产业化市级重点龙头企业的通知）.ofd", "appdocid": 1854673, "appfile": "P020221202592310452154.ofd", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/qtyzdgkdzfxx/202212/t20221202_1854673.htm", "fileext": "ofd", "_src": "/protect/P0202212/P020221202/P020221202592310452154.ofd", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/qtyzdgkdzfxx/202212/P020221202592310452154.ofd"}], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/qtyzdgkdzfxx/202212/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1852225, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "2022年第6期", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/202211/t20221129_1852225.htm", "content": "各县（市、区）人民政府，市直各单位：\n　　《推动矿产资源优势转化为产业发展优势若干意见》已经市委、市政府同意，现印发给你们，请认真抓好组织实施。\n\n\n\n　　三明市人民政府\n　　2022年11月18日\n\n\n　　推动矿产资", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/202211/t20221129_1852225.htm", "docreltime": "2022.11.29 15:33:00", "doctitle": "三明市人民政府关于印发推动矿产资源优势转化为产业发展优势若干意见的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "01", "fileno": "明政规〔2022〕5号", "idxid": "SM00100-020